+To add a new enum type
+      (For example: UShoeSize  with values USHOE_WIDE=0, USHOE_REGULAR, USHOE_NARROW, USHOE_COUNT)
+
+    0. Make sure that all lines you add are protected with appropriate uconfig guards,
